# 故意错误的拉伸配置(演示用,不会被执行):
# 各向同性恒压控压 + 变形 + 全周期 -> 应力被压回,拉不断
units metal
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.615
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * Cu_u3.eam
fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix 2 all deform 1 x erate 1e-4 units box remap x
dump 1 all atom 1000 dump.tensile
run 50000
